<view class="page bottom-space"><view class="eyebrow">SIGNATURE / 签约指引</view><view class="title">在微信网页中签署。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取签约中心配置…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="reload">重新读取入口配置</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{signing}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">{{signing.title}}</view><view class="field">1. 点击复制签约入口，在微信中打开。</view><view class="field">2. 使用与小程序相同手机号，通过短信登录。</view><view class="field">3. 核对本人资料、正式文档与业务记录，自行操作签署。</view><view class="field">4. 完成后手动返回此页，查询最新结果。</view><view class="notice">请使用与小程序相同手机号登录。完成签署后，手动返回小程序查询结果；网页返回或复制入口都不代表签署完成。</view><view wx:if="{{!signing.enabled}}" class="notice" role="alert">签约入口尚未启用，请联系运营。</view><button wx:if="{{signing.enabled}}" class="primary" bindtap="copyEntry" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">复制签约入口</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">签署进度</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'SIGNED'}}" class="tag">双方签署已归档</view><view wx:elif="{{status === 'VERIFIED'}}" class="tag">实名与证书已就绪</view><view wx:elif="{{status === 'REJECTED' || status === 'EXPIRED'}}" class="tag">本次签署已终止或过期</view><view wx:else class="tag">结果待核实</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice" role="status">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{statusError}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{statusError}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refreshStatus" disabled="{{busy}}">查询最新结果</button></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="back">返回原业务记录</button>
</view>
